<title>UK: Sedgwick Group shares start trading.</title>
<headline>Sedgwick Group shares start trading.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>British insurer Sedgwick Group Plc said on Monday its American Depositary Shares (ADSs) had begun trading on the New York Stock Exchange under the symbol SED.</p>
<p>Sedgwick's ADSs opened at about $10-5/8 in New York.</p>
<p>One ADS represented five ordinary shares.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
